    "long_instructions": "## Write It Yourself\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Build:** Add your first conditional to this adventure app.\r\n    - When the user chooses a **path**, your program should check **which button was clicked** and display a different message for each path.\r\n\r\n3. **Test:** Click both path buttons and make sure:\r\n   - Each choice shows a **different outcome**\r\n   - The message updates correctly every time\r\n\r\n4. **Check Code:** Look for where your code:\r\n   - listens for a button click  \r\n   - checks which choice was made (`if` / `else`)  \r\n   - updates the text based on the choice  \r\n"
